If the environment variable "VOXFUZZ_UNSET_916882" exists then, Print "missing". Otherwise, Print "yes". Print 'the first reading'.
If 'the first reading' then, Print "ASSERT ENV-10: expected 0 got 1", Exit 95. Print 'the first reading'.

