Print 'the door tag'.

--- ENV-03, ENV-04: an entry contains an equals sign ---
a text called 'the street sign' is environment's last.
a buffer called 'the street sign in bytes' is 'the street sign'.
a number called 'the street sign equals signs' is 0.
For each slot from 1 to 'the street sign in bytes''s size, If byte slot of 'the street sign in bytes' is 61 then, Set 'the street sign equals signs' to 'the street sign equals signs' add 1..
If 'the street sign in bytes''s size is not 0 and 'the street sign equals signs' is 0 then, Print "ASSERT ENV-04: expected 1 got {'the street sign equals signs'}", Exit 95. Print 'the street sign equals signs' as a boolean.
Print 'the street sign in bytes''s size as a boolean.

